{"name": "autocorrelation.0", "returns": "list[float]  # length n; out[0] is the signal energy", "steps": [{"args": {"seq": "@input.x"}, "class": "B", "op": "srmech.cascade.leaves.seq_len"}, {"bind": {"n": "@step[0].output", "x": "@input.x"}, "body": [{"body": [{"args": {"a": "@idx.i", "b": "@idx.k", "n": "@bind.n"}, "class": "I", "op": "mod_add"}, {"args": {"i": "@idx.i", "j": "@step[0].output", "x": "@bind.x"}, "class": "L", "op": "srmech.cascade.composites.correlation_product"}], "index": "i", "map_over": "@bind.x"}, {"args": {"values": "@step[0].output"}, "class": "M", "op": "srmech.cascade.composites.compensated_sum"}], "index": "k", "map_over": "@input.x"}], "summary": "Circular autocorrelation as an indexed map of indexed maps: out[k] = compensated_sum(x[i] * x[(i+k) mod n])."}